{"kind": "mod", "id": 2011, "name": "Actually Found In Raid (UPDATED)", "slug": "actually-found-in-raid-updated", "teaser": "Tired of killing a PMC and the loot isn't \"Found In Raid\", even though you literally just found it in the raid? Actually Found In Raid will make sure that AI PMCs spawn with all items as Found In Raid.", "owner_name": "RuKira", "downloads": 23957, "favourites": 47, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": "com.rukiragaming.actuallyfir", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-07-28T08:24:54.000000Z", "created_at": "2025-02-16T18:16:29.000000Z", "published_at": "2025-02-16T18:16:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.0.5", "latest_version": "1.0.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p><strong>About</strong></p>\n<p>Actually Found In Raid is a simple client side mod that will ensure all AI PMCs items are spawned as Found In Raid. Now when you loot a PMC, the items will be Found In Raid, like they should be, at least in my opinion.</p>\n<p>The mod can be toggled on/off using Configuration Manager.</p>\n<p>Place the dll file in your BepInEx/plugins folder.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>DO NOT USE WITH FIKA, FIKA HAS IT’S OWN FIR SETTINGS</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>original mod by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2340-actually-found-in-raid/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">privateryan  </a>permission granted by the SPT Staff Team</p>\n<h2>Shameless Plug</h2>\n<p>[MOD] <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2520-gunsmith-tweaks/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gunsmith Tweaks</a> - Ever wanted Mechanic to actually treat Gunsmith how it should be?</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 6033, "published_at": "202